    "notes": [
      "Depends on the landed Phase 40 shared extension theme and themed FAB overlay.",
      "The Settings Browser extension panel now reports scheme registration, retained SAF permission, exported document presence, byte count, SHA-256, app variant, contract, target, theme, and extension-version compatibility.",
      "Deep-link parsing now returns accepted, rejected, or not-applicable results so malformed XDM links do not fall through into generic external URL intake.",
      "Persisted diagnostics are bounded and redact query values, cookies, authorization, bearer tokens, credentials, and raw header surfaces.",
      "Interrupted generation and failed SAF replacement retain the previous verified XPI and expose specific recovery guidance.",
      "Gradle XPI output filenames now match generated extension version 1.1.0.",
      "No top-level route, Android browser runtime, Room migration, transfer-engine behavior, app version, or custom-scheme credential payload is introduced."
    ]
